  "releaseNotes": "0.4.1: the dotnet tool now installs and runs on .NET 8, 9 and 10. 0.4.0: iv:// references in environment variables and run --env-file (filled in before the command starts; groups as JSON); export --env-file; scan --history (every commit, --since, --max-commits); scan --vault finds values stored in the vault using salted hashes only (needs a vault update). Full history: CHANGELOG.md in the package.",
